    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_register_m_c_subtarget_info" kindref="compound">RegisterMCSubtargetInfo</ref> - Helper template for registering a target subtarget info implementation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This invokes the static &quot;Create&quot; method on the class to actually do the construction. Usage:</para>
<para>extern &quot;C&quot; void LLVMInitializeFooTarget() { extern <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_target" kindref="compound">Target</ref> TheFooTarget; RegisterMCSubtargetInfo&lt;FooMCSubtargetInfo&gt; <ref refid="_table_gen_backend_skeleton_8cpp_1ab60f28d7a141ac46ccc200176a1bca8b" kindref="member">X(TheFooTarget)</ref>; } </para>
